---
title: Container state machine including restart reconciliation to Orphaned
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Created
  Created --> Running : start
  Running --> Paused : pause
  Paused --> Running : resume
  Running --> Stopped : stop
  Running --> Failed : error
  Failed --> Stopped : stop
  Stopped --> [*]

  state "any PID state" as anyState
  anyState --> Orphaned : daemon restart
  Orphaned --> Running : restart keeps Paused only if PID alive and cgroup.freeze=1
  Orphaned --> Stopped : otherwise
